n to Frappe v16 and associated requirements.\n\n\nThe system architecture document explicitly identifies Frappe and ERPNext as v16+ agents, which reinforces the version requirement. Direct verification of this information is available through provided browser links. The Frappe framework and ERPNext (v16+) are clearly indicated as requirements in the linked architecture documentation.\n\n\n"}
